    {"id": 5, "claim": "LSD can remain in the body (specifically in fatty tissues like the spine) for years.", "evidence": "Medical literature and toxicology reports indicate that LSD can be stored in fatty tissues for extended periods, potentially years, which is a proposed mechanism for flashbacks.", "weight": 0.95, "depends_on": [3, 4]},
